The V-shaped neighbourhood system does not embed into its powerdomain.

<!-- formalization -->

**Definition (`HasTop`).** As set out for this part of the library.

*Proof.* By the failure of a top element in the V-shape and the preservation of tops by an embedding into a powerdomain. ∎

